<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Works best for defender weapons or weapons WITHOUT Acog</Major>
    <Description>A reoil reducing macro that is all purpose, meant for low recoil weapons or medium recoil weapons using a 1x sight. Generally will be more useful for defender weapons.
For Weapons WITH Acog, run AttackerWeapons V2, as it will be more compatible.

sens: 6, 6, 800 dpi 

res: 1920 x1080

aspect ratio: 16:10, 90 fov</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR 0 10
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 15
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 10
Delay 20 ms
MoveR -5 10
Delay 20 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>